      "start_seconds": 282.16,
      "end_seconds": 296.98,
      "duration_seconds": 14.82,
      "text": "okay, so my impression is this: I can't pin this down yet we're looking at a viral chest infection with mildly low oxygen or a bacterial pneumonia we should do a viral swab for fever and cough"
